        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: மீட்பு",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "மீட்பு — mīṭpu — \"a rescue\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ஒருவேளை படகு மூழ்கினால், மீட்புக் குழு தயாராக இருக்கிறது. oruvēḷai paṭaku mūḻkiṉāl, mīṭpuk kuḻu tayārāka irukkiṟatu. Should the boat sink, the rescue team is ready."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before a noun the stop doubles: மீட்புக் குழு, a rescue team."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "மீட்பு (mīṭpu) is native Dravidian: DEDR 4883 gives it under மீள், \"to return, be rescued\", with the sense \"releasing, redeeming\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
