              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): உயிர் பிழைத்தேன், uyir piḻaittēṉ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பிழை here means to escape harm; as a noun the same word is a mistake."
            }
          ]
        },
